# Allowed signers for Mandate grants (OpenSSH allowed_signers format).
# Generate the keypair on the approver's device, never on the host:
#   ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/mandate -C mandate
# Append the PUBLIC key with an explicit namespace scope:
#   <approver-name> namespaces="mandate" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nza... mandate
# Optional validity window: valid-after="YYYYMMDD" valid-before="YYYYMMDD".
# To revoke a key: mandat revoke --pub key.pub  (adds its SHA256 fingerprint
# to trust/revoked_signers).
